### 1. Hent de billettyper, der kan købes lige nu
GET http://localhost:8081/api/ticket-types/current

### 2. Opret en bestilling (ret ticketTypeId til et id fra svaret ovenfor)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactName": "Test Testesen",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "12345678",
  "participants": [
    { "fullName": "Anna Andersen", "ticketTypeId": 2 },
    { "fullName": "Bente Berg", "ticketTypeId": 2 }
  ]
}

### 3. Fejltest: mangler e-mail og deltagernavn (skal give 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactName": "Test Testesen",
  "participants": [
    { "fullName": "", "ticketTypeId": 2 }
  ]
}

### 4. Fejltest: early bird er udløbet (skal give 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactName": "Test Testesen",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "participants": [
    { "fullName": "Anna Andersen", "ticketTypeId": 1 }
  ]
}
